  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Against He Lang Zi, Fang Yuan gathers a spiral of starlight clouds the size of two or three elephants that spins and sucks attacks in toward the grindstone to grind them, then activates the star path immortal killer move. Against a close range fighter the field restricts movement and crushes slowly, so the same defense also hits hard in melee.",
      "chapters": [
        876
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_lang_zi",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He jumps into the grindstone himself so it keeps crushing the enemy while he stays unharmed and unobstructed inside. When He Lang Zi in fragrant sorcerer yin statue wolf form goes for a cloud building instead, Fang Yuan casts star snake rope from the grindstone’s edge: six starlight ropes with snake-head ends coil the wolf and, with the grindstone, drag it in; an onlooker notes the two moves can coordinate.",
      "chapters": [
        876
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fight-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When star snake rope is coordinated with the grindstone, their power amplifies. Inside, starlight specks grind the wolf body while the ropes tighten, until He Lang Zi’s lightning blast breaks the ropes and later a lightning pillar puts the grindstone on the verge of destruction. Fang Yuan later places grindstones as shields that ancient desolate lightning still destroys one after another. Star cloud grindstone, star snake rope, and six illusion star bodies all use Star Mark, Star Shoot, and Starlight as cores from Star Lord Wan Xiang’s complete star path inheritance and complement each other.",
      "chapters": [
        877
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "coordination-and-cores",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit notes Fang Yuan’s coordination between star cloud grindstone and star snake ropes, and between six illusion star bodies and position star swap, as better than the land spirit’s own disjointed casts.",
      "chapters": [
        881
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "land-spirit-praise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a silver giant form, one arm forms a star cloud spiral five or six times ordinary size and fifty to sixty percent faster, sucks in Immortal Gu House Dark Prison, grinds it, then explodes so Dark Prison charges out from the fragments.",
      "chapters": [
        884
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battle-formation-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_dark_prison"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With only three star path Immortal Gu (Star Mark, Starlight, and Star Shoot) he can use four star path killer moves by rotating those Gu as cores.",
      "chapters": [
        886
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-gu-limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
